        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DP675, 6 Inch Traditional Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nHigh quality solid brass door pull that is not to plain, but not to fancy. It is one of our best selling door pulls. Available in your choice of 9 different finish colors including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, antique nickel, polished chrome, antique brass, and polished brass. Manufactured by Deltana the nations most complete provider of all of your solid brass door hardware needs. The Solid Brass 6\" Door Pull has a 1\" diameter with a 2-1/2\" projection.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/deltana-DP675-size.gif?v=1704354762\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana DP675 6 Inch C-Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Longer <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-8-inch-door-pull-deltana-dp2574\"><b>8 Inch Door Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-10-inch-door-pull-deltana-dp2575\"><b>10 Inch Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with thru-bolt mounting screws. You can use <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-decorative-screw-cover-deltana-scd100\"><b>Decorative Screw Covers</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/sleek-screw-cover-deltana-scf100\"><b>Flat Top Screw Covers</b></a> to hide the screw heads on the inside of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Deltana DP675 Traditional 6 Inch Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Hole Spacing: 6\" </li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Screws: 1/4\"-24 x 2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DP675.pdf?v=1704262151\"><b>Deltana DP675 6\" Door Pull Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 6 Inch Door Pull | Deltana DP675",
                "description": "6 Inch Traditional Door Pull Deltana DP675 - High quality solid brass door pull that is not to plain, but not to fancy. It is one of our best selling door pulls. Available in your choice of 9 different finish colors including oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, antique nickel, polished chrome, antique brass, and polished brass. Manufactured by Deltana the nations most complete provider of all of your solid brass door hardware needs. The Solid Brass 6 inch Door Pull has a 1 inch diameter with a 2 inch projection.",
